[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Every possible biased exponent, with a few mantissas each: this covers the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// whole `%a` exponent range (`p-1022` .. `p+1023`), the subnormal and
