[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    287[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Random values restricted to exponents where `%.4f` prints something
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    288[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// interesting (roughly 1e-8 .. 1e12), which the uniform bit sweep almost never
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    289[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// hits.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    290[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #[test]
